Any acquired entities or assets may not enhance our results of operations. Even if we are able to integrate future

acquired businesses with our operations successfully, we cannot assure you that we will realize the cost savings,

synergies or revenue enhancements that we may anticipate from such integration or that we will realize such benefits

within the expected time frame. Any acquisition also may cause us to assume liabilities, record goodwill and other

intangible assets that will be subject to impairment testing and potential impairment charges, incur potential

restructuring charges and increase working capital, and capital expenditure requirements.

